KEY FILES:
==========

QUICK START:
→ README.md                                    (Getting started)

DEPLOYMENT:
→ BACKEND_INTEGRATION_READINESS.md            (Backend status)
→ DEPLOYMENT_READINESS_FINAL.md               (Production ready?)
→ FINAL_INTEGRATION_VERIFICATION.md           (API contracts)
→ scripts/deploy/                             (Deployment scripts)

DOCUMENTATION:
→ docs/api/                                   (API reference)
→ docs/architecture/                          (System design)
→ docs/deployment/                            (How to deploy)
→ docs/guides/                                (User guides)

SOURCE CODE:
→ src/backend/autonomous_system/              (Core logic)
→ src/frontend/                               (React UI)

INFRASTRUCTURE:
→ infrastructure/docker/                      (Docker)
→ infrastructure/kubernetes/                  (K8s)
→ infrastructure/terraform/                   (Cloud IaC)
→ infrastructure/helm/                        (Helm)

TESTING:
→ tests/                                      (1,511+ tests)
→ scripts/test/                               (Test scripts)

CONFIGURATION:
→ config/production/                          (Prod config)
→ config/development/                         (Dev config)
→ config/testing/                             (Test config)


